                "text": "The Trump Administration\u2019s attempts to strip access to health care away from people are cruel. Thanks to this ruling, people enrolled in Medicaid can still access essential care at Planned Parenthood. This is how it should be, and how it should stay.\n\nhttps://t.co/3QiAKC8u3Q",
