                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today marks the 60-year anniversary of Medicare and Medicaid. Yet as we celebrate this milestone, we\u2019re reeling from the largest cuts to those programs in history. Shamelessly, Republicans have turned their backs on the American people.\n\nDemocrats have always stood up for those who need access to care, and we won\u2019t ever stop fighting for you.",
