                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My friend Sam is just 13 years old, but he\u2019s an inspiration to us all. Diagnosed with Down Syndrome, Autism, and a severe speech impediment, Sam relies on Medicaid to get the care he needs.\n\nSam is why House Democrats are fighting to protect your Medicare and Medicaid and reverse these devastating cuts.",
