                "text": "The Congressional Budget Office\u2019s most recent analysis of Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Bill confirms what we\u2019ve been warning about. Everyday Americans will carry the burden while Donald Trump\u2019s friends get richer.\n \nHealth insurance premiums for Covered CA plans are slated to increase by $2,110 for Sacramentans.\n \nRepublicans have shamelessly sold out the American people, but House Dems are united in fighting back. We won\u2019t back down.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZmFFm0NIOo",
