                "text": "Yesterday\u2019s court decision strips thousands of Sacramento families of cancer screenings, birth control, STI testing, and more. For many, especially low-income women and teens, these clinics are the only trusted provider for affordable care.\n\nBlocking Planned Parenthood\u2019s Medicaid funding is a direct assault on women\u2019s health and lifesaving medical services in our community.\n\nhttps://t.co/y62qUvRSyH",
