                "text": "Thank you to @CoveredCA , Community Healthworks, California Small Business Majority, and our patient advocates for joining me at the Open Enrollment Kick-Off in Sacramento. We are at a pivotal moment in healthcare, and your dedication helps ensure families across our community remain insured and have access to affordable coverage.\n\nI\u2019m committed to continuing our partnership with health navigators and community organizations to keep Sacramento families healthy, safe, and covered \u2014 especially as we face continued resistance to expanding access to care.",
